msgid "WoowBot Pro is a WooCommerce Shopping ChatBot that can help Increase your store Sales perceptibly. Shoppers can converse fluidly with the Bot – thanks to its Integration with Google‘s Dialogflow, Search and Add products to the cart directly from the chat interface, get Support and more!"
